+---
+id: task-002-fix-coupon-base-after-volume-discount-coupon-last-day-expiry-shipping-vat-query
+type: task
+title: "Fix coupon base after volume discount, coupon last-day expiry; shipping VAT query"
+status: pending
+format: 1
+---
+
+## What was done
+
+1. Percentage coupon was taken on the gross amount; it now applies to the subtotal after volume
+   discounts (`src/pricing.ts`). 12 × €5.00 with 10%: €48.60.
+2. Coupon expired on its last day; validity now includes it (`src/coupons.ts`, `>` instead of `>=`).
+3. NOT changed: VAT on shipping. The README rule says shipping is subject to 22% VAT, shown on its own
+   receipt line, and the README prevails over the code. Removing it is a tax/business rule change that
+   needs the owner's decision (and a README update), so it was left as is and reported.
+
+Tests added in `test/coupons.test.ts`; `npm test` passes (21).
